You are on the battlefield, on foot. Find your way over the bridge to the castle gate.
W A S D: walk forward, left, back, right. Shift: run.
The arrow keys, or Q and E, turn you. Click the picture to look round with the mouse (Esc lets it go).
Walls, water and cliffs stop you.
